dd an art-museum option","subtitle":"Saturday afternoon · Tampa Riverwalk","notes":"If the museum is open and you want an indoor stop, check its official visit information before heading in. Otherwise, note its Riverwalk location for a later planned visit.","short_summary":"A named museum option along the downtown Riverwalk.","evidence_claim":"The City of Tampa lists the Tampa Museum of Art among museums along the Tampa Riverwalk.","source_url":"https://www.tampa.gov/parks-and-recreation/featured-parks/riverwalk","source_title":"Tampa Riverwalk | City of Tampa","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":"2025-09-13","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Check the museum’s official site for current admission, hours and exhibit access before visiting.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"henry-b-plant-museum","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Henry B. Plant Museum","title":"Circle back to the Plant-era museum","subtitle":"Sunday afternoon · Tampa Riverwalk / Plant Hall","notes":"Use the museum as a history-focused final stop if it is open. Confirm admission and exhibit access before going, then connect what you saw back to Plant Hall’s campus history.","short_summary":"A Riverwalk-listed museum associated with the historic Plant-era setting.","evidence_claim":"The City of Tampa lists the Henry B. Plant Museum among museums along the Tampa Riverwalk.","source_url":"https://www.tampa.gov/parks-and-recreation/featured-parks/riverwalk","source_title":"Tampa Riverwalk | City of Tampa","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":"2025-09-13","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Check the museum’s official site for current admission, hours and visitor policies.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"water-works-park","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Water Works Park","title":"End at Water Works Park","subtitle":"Sunday daylight · Tampa Riverwalk","notes":"Finish with a relaxed riverside walk or picnic-area break. The park connects to the Riverwalk and has open green space, shaded seating and waterfront views for a low-key close.","short_summary":"A public riverfront park with Riverwalk access and no admission fee.","evidence_claim":"The City of Tampa says Water Works Park is open to the public, connects to the Tampa Riverwalk and has no admission fee.","source_url":"https://www.tampa.gov/index.php/parks-and-recreation/featured-parks/waterworks","source_title":"Water Works Park | City of Tampa","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":"2018-08-13","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"City-listed hours are 7 a.m.–10 p.m.; use the park during posted hours and follow park rules.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
